 7.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Postchelation (68&#x02013;112 weeks)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11.4 &#x000b1; 3.1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10.7 &#x000b1; 3.8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40.1 &#x000b1; 2.1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">37.3 &#x000b1; 3.6</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>